  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      147.6,
      382.63,
      294.65,
      403.52
    ],
    "text": "My No. : AO/MN/01/07/2014.Land Ministry No. : 4-3/2014/D/195.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      425.36,
      295.02,
      478.4
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment ) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude which is required fora security purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      66.48,
      489.67,
      276.16,
      499.76
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or Servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      511.04,
      294.77,
      585.44
    ],
    "text": "The land allotment called selluvari in total extent of about4.1359 Hectares depicted as Lot No. 1 in Plan No. MN 741land prepared by Surveyor General situated in the villagecalled Pavillupaddan Kudiyiruppu, in the Grama NiladariDivision No. MN/53 of Kaddukarankudiyiruppu, in theDivisional Secretary's Division of Mannar town of MannarDistrict in North Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      66.48,
      596.71,
      137.51,
      606.79
    ],
    "text": "Plan No. MN 741",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
