      308.4,
      340.16,
      548.32,
      362.24
    ],
    "text": "Commission; Original Claimant: Land Reform Commission;Extent: 4.1359 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      317.28,
      376.15,
      474.64,
      386.24
    ],
    "text": "The dates and the time of the inquiries:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      308.4,
      400.16,
      548.53,
      458.24
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha Servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally or by agents duly authorized in writting before meat 10.00 a.m. on 28th February 2019 at Mannar DivisionalSecretariat.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      308.4,
      472.4,
      548.59,
      544.4
    ],
    "text": "And further you are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting (in duplicate) on or before the 23rd February 2019 thenature of their interest in the land, the particulars of theirclaims for the compensation for the acquision of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
